<title>ITALY: Italian total bank lending rises 2.6 in Jan.</title>
<headline>Italian total bank lending rises 2.6 in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian total bank lending rose 2.6 percent year-on-year in January, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. It issued the following provisional year-on-year percentage changes:</p>
<p>			  Jan 1997    Dec 1996	 Jan 1996</p>
<p>Total bank lending  +2.6	    +2.4%	   +3.7%</p>
<p>Lira bank lending   +3.0	    +3.2%	   +8.0%</p>
<p>Deposits		+3.6	    +2.5%	   +1.8%</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
